    LLM: "Try to capture aces by winning tricks when they are played. The last trick is crucial - save a high card for it. When bidding, assess whether you can capture 3 of the 5 points.\n\nCount cards to track which aces have been played. Coordinate with partner when defending against the bidder. When bidding, consider your ace holdings and endgame potential. The 3s and 2s are the most powerful cards.\n\nSophisticated bidding based on hand evaluation. Card counting to track all high cards. Strategic play to force out opponents' high cards. Endgame technique for securing the last trick.",
